Phase 2 runs from the hand off below, and DECISIONS.md holds every choice made on the way. Done: the
probes and the scoped model gate; the plan hashed as the models stage; the sets, {{ v("models.sets.train.rows") }} train,
{{ v("models.sets.development.rows") }} development, {{ v("models.sets.test.rows") }} test and {{ v("models.sets.shadow.rows") }} shadow rows; the floors, where the band floor reaches a
development kappa of {{ v("models.floors.band.dev") }}; the fallback text model, at {{ v("models.fallback.band.dev") }}; the exploitation models, where
LightGBM holds {{ v("models.rank.lgbm.dev_recall_at_top5") }} of the development listings in its top five percent and the floor
{{ v("models.rank.floor.dev_recall_at_top5") }}{% if has("models.rank.runs.count") %}, from the run with the numeric kernels pinned, the one of {{ v("models.rank.runs.count") }} runs that reproduced
on a second processor{% endif %}; the survival models, checked in R ({{ v("models.survival.r_check.result") }}); the ONNX exports
({{ v("models.onnx.parity") }}); calibration, conformal sets and the shadow weights on development; the misses read; the
